  "content": {
    "component": "news_article",
    "_uid": "251-root",
    "title": "President of Pakistan confers awards on two AKU faculty",
    "subtitle": null,
    "summary": "Professors Enam and Bhutta recognised for their work in medicine and healthcare education",
    "media": [
      {
        "_uid": "d30341be61dc51e2",
        "component": "news_media",
        "role": "banner",
        "filename": "251-BannerImage.jpg",
        "src": "/news-media/251-BannerImage.jpg",
        "media_type": "image",
        "caption": null,
        "alt": "President of Pakistan confers awards on two AKU faculty"
      },
      {
        "_uid": "36fe7f36572e5f3c",
        "component": "news_media",
        "role": "medium",
        "filename": "251-MediumImage.jpg",
        "src": "/news-media/251-MediumImage.jpg",
        "media_type": "image",
        "caption": null,
        "alt": "President of Pakistan confers awards on two AKU faculty"
      }
    ],
    "body": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Pakistan's President Mamnoon Hussain has conferred prestigious awards on two senior professors at the Aga Khan University."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Professor Syed Ather Enam",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "link",
                  "attrs": {
                    "href": "/news/sitara-i-imtiaz-conferred-on-professor-ather-enam",
                    "target": "_self",
                    "linktype": "story",
                    "uuid": "250cfeef-758b-5c4d-a904-dcfc330c05b3",
                    "anchor": null,
                    "custom": {}
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ", Chair of the Department of Surgery at AKU, has been awarded Pakistan's third highest civilian award, the "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Sitara-i-Imtiaz",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "italic"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ", for his work in the field of medicine. "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Professor Zulfiqar Bhutta",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "link",
                  "attrs": {
                    "href": "/news/president-of-pakistan-honours-professor-zulfiqar-bhutta",
                    "target": "_self",
                    "linktype": "story",
                    "uuid": "736d1ca0-0449-5aa2-9206-dadd9274fc75",
                    "anchor": null,
                    "custom": {}
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ", Founding Director of the Centre of Excellence in Women and Child Health at the University, has been honoured with a Pride of Performance Award for his contributions to healthcare education."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The announcement was made on Independence Day, August 14, 2016, where the President conferred awards on a number of Pakistani citizens and foreign nationals for demonstrating excellence in their respective fields."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Speaking about the awards, Farhat Abbas, Dean of the Medical College at AKU, said: \"Throughout their careers, Dr Enam and Dr Bhutta have upheld the highest standards in their respective fields. A generation of surgeons and researchers have honed their skills under their supervision and are making an impact in their chosen fields of service. I congratulate them both on this richly deserved honour.\""
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
